        <p class="lead">From preventive care to advanced restorative and cosmetic solutions—our team designs care around your goals, budget, and timeline.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-3 mt-3">
        <section id="preventive" class="card" style="padding:1.5rem">
          <h2 class="h2">Preventive & Family</h2>
          <p class="text-muted">Keep problems small and smiles strong with regular visits and protective treatments.</p>
          <ul class="list-clean stack mt-1">
            <li class="benefit"><span class="dot"></span><span>Cleanings & Exams for all ages</span></li>
            <li class="benefit"><span class="dot"></span><span>Digital X‑rays & 3D imaging</span></li>
