            <li class="benefit"><span class="dot"></span><span>Nightguards & Sportsguards</span></li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section id="cosmetic" class="card" style="padding:1.5rem">
          <h2 class="h2">Cosmetic Dentistry</h2>
          <p class="text-muted">Natural-looking enhancements for confidence that starts with your smile.</p>
          <ul class="list-clean stack mt-1">
            <li class="benefit"><span class="dot"></span><span>Professional Whitening</span></li>
            <li class="benefit"><span class="dot"></span><span>Bonding & Tooth Contouring</span></li>
            <li class="benefit"><span class="dot"></span><span>Porcelain Veneers</span></li>
            <li class="benefit"><span class="dot"></span><span>Clear Aligners (Invisalign)</span></li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section id="restorative" class="card" style="padding:1.5rem">
          <h2 class="h2">Implants & Restorative</h2>
          <p class="text-muted">Durable, comfortable solutions to repair or replace missing and damaged teeth.</p>
          <ul class="list-clean stack mt-1">
            <li class="benefit"><span class="dot"></span><span>Tooth‑colored Fillings</span></li>
            <li class="benefit"><span class="dot"></span><span>Crowns & Bridges (often same‑day)</span></li>
            <li class="benefit"><span class="dot"></span><span>Root Canal Therapy</span></li>
            <li class="benefit"><span class="dot"></span><span>Dental Implants & Implant Dentures</span></li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-2 mt-3">
        <section id="periodontal" class="card" style="padding:1.5rem">
          <h2 class="h2">Periodontal Health</h2>
          <p class="text-muted">Gentle deep cleanings and home‑care coaching to protect your gums and overall health.</p>
          <div class="accordion mt-1">
            <details>
              <summary>Scaling & Root Planing <span class="pill">Therapeutic</span></summary>
              <div class="panel text-muted">Non‑surgical therapy that removes bacteria below the gums to stop disease progression.</div>
            </details>
            <details>
              <summary>Maintenance Visits</summary>
              <div class="panel text-muted">Customized hygiene schedules to maintain healthy gums after therapy.</div>
            </details>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section id="emergency" class="card" style="padding:1.5rem">
          <h2 class="h2">Emergency Dentistry</h2>
          <p class="text-muted">Same‑day relief for toothaches, broken teeth, and urgent dental needs. Call us now.</p>
          <div class="callout mt-1"><strong>Call:</strong> <a class="link" href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
        </section>
      </div>

      <div class="card mt-3" style="padding:1.5rem">
        <h2 class="h2">Technology that respects your time</h2>
        <ul class="list-clean stack mt-1">
          <li class="benefit"><span class="dot"></span><span>3D cone‑beam imaging for precise planning</span></li>
          <li class="benefit"><span class="dot"></span><span>Digital scanners—no messy impressions</span></li>
          <li class="benefit"><span class="dot"></span><span>In‑office milling for many same‑day crowns</span></li>
